[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.2 System overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SCMP-001-MILUAV
TITLE: System Overview
STATEMENT: The Military Quad Copter RTOS requires comprehensive configuration management for software, hardware, documentation, and operational procedures for military deployment.
RATIONALE: System overview provides context for configuration management.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.3 Document overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SCMP-002-MILUAV
TITLE: Document Structure
STATEMENT: This document covers configuration management organization, referenced documents, configuration identification, and change control per MIL-STD-498.
RATIONALE: Structured documentation supports effective configuration management.

[[/SECTION]]

